    following effects of \"Ojama Pajama\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF During the Main
    Phase: You can add 1 \"Ojama\" card from your Deck to your hand, then discard
    1 card.\r\n\u25CF If this card is sent to the GY: You can Special Summon as many
    of your banished \"Ojama\" monsters as possible."
